      "target": "중세에는 성이 많았어요.",
      "reading": "jungse-eneun seongi manasseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "In the Middle Ages, there were many castles.",
        "ko": "중세에는 성이 많았어요.",
        "ipa": "jungse-eneun seongi manasseoyo.",
        "ar": "في العصور الوسطى، كانت هناك الكثير من القلاع.",
        "cs": "Ve středověku bylo hodně hradů.",
        "da": "I middelalderen var der mange slotte.",
        "de": "Im Mittelalter gab es viele Burgen.",
